n=$.c==="en"
m=n?"Step 4: Yellow cross":"B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: D\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng v\xe0ng"
l=n?"Make a yellow cross on the top face (ignore the corners).":"T\u1ea1o d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng v\xe0ng \u1edf m\u1eb7t tr\xean (b\u1ecf qua c\xe1c g\xf3c)."
k=n?"Dot (only the yellow centre): do F R U R' U' F' from any angle and you'll get an L shape.":"Ch\u1ea5m (ch\u1ec9 c\xf3 t\xe2m v\xe0ng): l\xe0m F R U R' U' F' \u1edf h\u01b0\u1edbng n\xe0o c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c, s\u1ebd ra h\xecnh ch\u1eef L."
j=n?"L shape: put the 2 yellow edges at the back and left, do F U R U' R' F'.":"Ch\u1eef L: \u0111\u1eb7t 2 c\u1ea1nh v\xe0ng \u1edf sau v\xe0 tr\xe1i, l\xe0m F U R U' R' F'."
k=A.b([k,j,n?"Line: hold it horizontally, do F R U R' U' F'.":"\u0110\u01b0\u1eddng th\u1eb3ng: \u0111\u1eb7t n\u1eb1m ngang, l\xe0m F R U R' U' F'."],s)
n=$.c==="en"
j=n?"Line / dot":"\u0110\u01b0\u1eddng th\u1eb3ng / ch\u1ea5m"
n=n?"L shape (back + left)":"Ch\u1eef L (sau + tr\xe1i)"
